Notebook[{
Cell["Structured arrays in QuantumFramework: where they pay", "Title",
 CellID->874461601,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "QuantumFramework (QF) stores every operator as a ",
 Cell[BoxData["SparseArray"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],
 ", even when the operator was built as a diagonal, a permutation, a Fourier \
matrix or a block-diagonal matrix. Wolfram Language structured arrays (",
 Cell[BoxData["DiagonalMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["PermutationMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["FourierMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["BlockDiagonalMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],
 ") keep that structure, and WL's linear algebra uses it. Each section below \
takes one operation QF performs, writes it as a formula, runs QF's current \
code, runs the same operation on a structured array, and times both."
}], "Text",
 CellID->36768919,ExpressionUUID->"5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],

Cell["\<\
The sizes are chosen where QF's current code takes at least about a second. \
Below that, no difference is worth a change to QF. QF's own property cache \
stays on, and each QF timing is the first call on a freshly built operator. \
Each structured timing is the fastest of three runs, each after clearing the \
system cache.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1699946459,ExpressionUUID->"56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],

Cell["Setup", "Section",
 CellID->1535504786,ExpressionUUID->"5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],

Cell["Load QF from the working tree:", "Text",
 CellID->1208482393,ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
  "PacletDirectoryLoad", 
   "[", "\"\</Users/mohammadb/Documents/GitHub/QuantumFramework/\
QuantumFramework\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<Wolfram`QuantumFramework`\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"$Version", ",", " ", "$ProcessorCount"}], "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",
 CellID->28909615,ExpressionUUID->"166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["timeQF"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],
 " times one call; ",
 Cell[BoxData["timeNew"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],
 " takes the fastest of three calls; ",
 Cell[BoxData["compare"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],
 " sets the two side by side, with their ratio:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->193832008,ExpressionUUID->"6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetAttributes", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"timeQF", ",", " ", "timeNew"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "HoldFirst"}], 
   "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", "e_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ClearSystemCache", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"First", "[", 
      RowBox[{"AbsoluteTiming", "[", 
       RowBox[{"e", ";"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", "e_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ClearSystemCache", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", 
       RowBox[{"First", "[", 
        RowBox[{"AbsoluteTiming", "[", 
         RowBox[{"e", ";"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
    RowBox[{"q_", ",", " ", "s_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<QF\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<structured\>\"", ",", 
         " ", "\"\<QF / structured\>\""}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Quantity", "[", 
          RowBox[{"q", ",", " ", "\"\<Seconds\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Quantity", "[", 
          RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "\"\<Seconds\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"q", "/", "s"}], ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], 
     ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",
 CellID->684317082,ExpressionUUID->"23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Several sections use the Ising energy ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "=", 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], "<", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]}],
    LimitsPositioning->False], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"i", "j"}], "TI"]], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],
 " of every computational basis state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "=", "\[PlusMinus]", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],
 " the spins of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"],
 ". This is the diagonal of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], "<", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]}],
    LimitsPositioning->False], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"i", "j"}], "TI"]], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->528485616,ExpressionUUID->"76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"zz", "[", "n_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"J", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"RandomReal", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"z", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "n"}], 
           "]"}]}]}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"J", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "i"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"i", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "7", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
  RowBox[{"zz", "[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",
 CellID->1392207227,ExpressionUUID->"0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"],

Cell["1. Evolution under a diagonal Hamiltonian", "Section",
 CellID->705466992,ExpressionUUID->"4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],

Cell["\<\
The time-evolution operator of an Ising Hamiltonian, the cost unitary of QAOA:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1350516518,ExpressionUUID->"741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Theta]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"-", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Theta]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["H", "TI"]}]]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["i", "TI"], "<", 
       StyleBox["j", "TI"]}],
      LimitsPositioning->False], 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
       StyleBox[
        RowBox[{"i", "j"}], "TI"]], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}]}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->907546795,ExpressionUUID->"3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"],
 " is diagonal, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["U", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],
 " is diagonal with entries ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Theta]", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"],
 ". QF computes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "\[Theta]", " ", "qo"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"],
 " as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Log", "[", "E", "]"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"op", "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04646437-faee-7dfc-2c1c-7e70fe9b47c6"],
 " on the stored ",
 Cell[BoxData["SparseArray"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1cbde497-e826-5557-4442-fdd089d33fbd"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", "577"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ecb37d0-fbcc-3e82-16c8-ae9dfe7e84e8"],
 "). The structured array exponentiates each diagonal entry."
}], "Text",
 CellID->814772321,ExpressionUUID->"4c358d3e-86d3-ec5f-75ca-25783367b6a5"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "14"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"\[Theta]", " ", "=", " ", "0.3"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"h", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"zz", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qo", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "h"}], 
      "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", "n", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomComplex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "-", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:= ",
 CellID->1054628905,ExpressionUUID->"1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", "\n", "    ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "\[Theta]", " ", "qo"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
   "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "\[Theta]", " ", "h"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
      "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "\n", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",
 CellID->2043779557,ExpressionUUID->"5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],

Cell["\<\
Both give the same operator; the difference of the two results applied to a \
random state is:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->17830494,ExpressionUUID->"110914de-bbdd-83a1-4736-8d983e69d18b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "\[Theta]", " ", "qo"}], "]"}], 
     "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}], " ", "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "\[Theta]", " ", "h"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
      "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:= ",
 CellID->1589986527,ExpressionUUID->"76d004f9-29e5-6665-1eef-9da34f904d4f"],

Cell["\<\
The work QF does grows with the matrix, while the structured array does one \
exponential per basis state. Each qubit added doubles the structured cost and \
multiplies QF's by far more, so the gap widens with every qubit.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->943101875,ExpressionUUID->"2c76c797-c249-79ca-540d-ded0f7fc4b10"],

Cell["2. A function of a diagonal operator", "Section",
 CellID->67888809,ExpressionUUID->"35077f55-9291-6519-633d-771f27244c63"],

Cell["Any function of a diagonal operator acts entry by entry:", "Text",
 CellID->1432876021,ExpressionUUID->"4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["cos",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["diag",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
   StyleBox["cos",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    FontSize->1.2 Inherited]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->876231958,ExpressionUUID->"65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "QF sends ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "qo", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],
 " through ",
 Cell[BoxData["matrixFunction"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Utilities", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", 
    RowBox[{"313", "-", "317"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],
 "). When the stored matrix passes ",
 Cell[BoxData["DiagonalMatrixQ"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Utilities", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", "330"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],
 "), QF applies the function to each diagonal entry, which is the same \
computation a structured ",
 Cell[BoxData["DiagonalMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfe104a-50de-a555-0985-8a1461680fbf"],
 " performs, so here QF already uses the structure without storing it:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1020575516,ExpressionUUID->"134534fb-1061-d656-417a-ada5a115bcbc"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "12"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"h", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"zz", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qo", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "h"}], 
      "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", "n", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", "\n", "    ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "qo", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "h", "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
     "]"}], "]"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:= ",
 CellID->1967685850,ExpressionUUID->"2cd98fd2-34e7-e188-54e6-269cbc93b3d2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For a diagonal operator, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["diag",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"],
 " is the exact answer, so it is also the check; the largest entry-wise error \
of QF's result:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1044562475,ExpressionUUID->"608e87cc-8fce-afdf-10b5-1e962a78f525"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "qo", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
    " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "h", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:= ",
 CellID->1653200050,ExpressionUUID->"2aa912c6-4938-1bb7-5a56-8ba068cd699d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["DiagonalMatrixQ"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66b4bee0-d247-b105-0e4b-37cde7f3006f"],
 " treats an off-diagonal entry at the level of rounding error, relative to \
the size of the matrix, as zero. Dropping such an entry changes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "337c2d89-644e-5b5e-6103-c4d30dfb29a4"],
 " by about as much as floating-point evaluation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7c2741-1c81-ec9b-0503-bf2b9535b6e1"],
 " already does, while any entry large enough to be a real coupling keeps the \
matrix off this route. The test reads only the stored nonzero entries of a ",
 Cell[BoxData["SparseArray"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "644cc522-c7c4-9b18-0c73-dc8ff276e662"],
 ", so it costs a fraction of a millisecond even for twelve qubits:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1384978530,ExpressionUUID->"2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
  RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrixQ", "[", 
   RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[9]:= ",
 CellID->519689844,ExpressionUUID->"6801f052-da94-0b6f-183e-ea1fdf2159b5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["MatrixFunction"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0daf8e98-7628-e40b-3b54-27c203c2cf51"],
 " applied to a structured ",
 Cell[BoxData["DiagonalMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"],
 " computes the right values but returns an ordinary dense matrix, so the \
structure is lost; writing the diagonal of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"],
 " directly keeps it:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1609367578,ExpressionUUID->"14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Head", " ", "/@", " ", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"MatrixFunction", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Cos", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
       "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "h", "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
     "]"}]}], "}"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[10]:= ",
 CellID->1541450781,ExpressionUUID->"5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],

Cell["3. Spectrum of a permutation", "Section",
 CellID->1657269721,ExpressionUUID->"3b7fe4cc-5889-7f4e-6904-fd96593c4594"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cyclic shift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]], 
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["k", "TI"]},
     "Ket"]}], "=", 
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["k", "TI"], "+", "1", 
       StyleBox["mod", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"]}]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6cb5c01f-62f5-68e0-144a-da5916803aca"],
 " is a permutation with a single cycle of length ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "55f417ec-7166-d78d-038b-8eb60010bdd7"],
 ", so its eigenvalues are the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b6e5dad-9702-0c1f-7916-54f722b75765"],
 "-th roots of unity:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1140508347,ExpressionUUID->"1d359769-845f-cd94-44ca-0f332deb97fe"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["spec",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "{", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "/", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]}]], 
   SubsuperscriptBox["}", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "0"}], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], "-", "1"}]]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->496109794,ExpressionUUID->"2055bfee-d4b5-7aa2-506a-36cbdd404888"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "QF's ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Eigenvalues\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "64c30c0d-1857-1b13-0cf0-a65799e26679"],
 " (",
 Cell["QuantumOperator/Properties.m:506", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "46632a09-cc5f-b0ef-6e10-cc52e5eb0235"],
 ") computes the full ",
 Cell[BoxData["Eigensystem"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ea251ed-865f-e03c-1652-48b733ebb306"],
 " of the exact matrix and simplifies it (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Utilities", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", "162"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25a0bfbe-b1d4-2428-535f-36fbc0668f72"],
 "). ",
 Cell[BoxData["PermutationMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04786d0e-016a-d127-2c07-8568b01ca00d"],
 " reads the spectrum from the cycle structure. QF's ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<X\>\"", "[", "d", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d15b43a-cd49-5244-5b2a-2e67e4fc20ae"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"PermutationMatrix", "[", 
   RowBox[{"RotateRight", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Range", "[", "d", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d1ff276-b82a-c3ca-5b24-f43039dc9110"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->108435171,ExpressionUUID->"14fd1512-f616-8834-3c82-8d5f83a0db1e"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"d", " ", "=", " ", "64"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qo", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<X\>\"", "[", "d", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"P", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PermutationMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"RotateRight", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Range", "[", "d", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
   RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Normal", "[", "P", "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[11]:= ",
 CellID->829388421,ExpressionUUID->"66c67103-72a1-9427-0efe-696d0755ff0d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", "P", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[12]:= ",
 CellID->203008389,ExpressionUUID->"48c794f4-84f6-2bfc-78fc-0dbe2c8379c6"],

Cell["The two spectra are the same set:", "Text",
 CellID->1090263105,ExpressionUUID->"58ee7ecb-1370-1005-0896-7795a605636f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "==", 
  " ", 
  RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", "P", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[13]:= ",
 CellID->1560876240,ExpressionUUID->"11d04a92-cbef-a8a5-47e0-63dfed9bfa8f"],

Cell["4. Spectrum of the quantum Fourier transform", "Section",
 CellID->176337227,ExpressionUUID->"7d9821c9-0e61-bc6d-2ba7-b893ab1506b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The QFT on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3181a460-bc62-f1ee-67be-3e4a3514c334"],
 " qubits is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox["2", 
   StyleBox["n", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3937e1d4-04c3-e55a-68cc-f89ead77cfa0"],
 "-point Fourier matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"j", "k"}], "TI"]], "=", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"j", "k"}], "TI"]], "/", 
   SqrtBox[
    SuperscriptBox["2", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b45e796-37a7-eecc-197a-fed04253b416"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "=", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], "/", 
     SuperscriptBox["2", 
      StyleBox["n", "TI"]]}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e187950-8ca2-2ab2-0638-711a25577898"],
 ". Since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], "4"], "=", 
   StyleBox["I", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "250a2d7c-9b81-05b0-5309-c5261e346f9a"],
 ", its eigenvalues lie in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", "1"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15a9104d-5625-6af3-4356-8a1763d038d9"],
 ", with known multiplicities. QF builds the operator of its ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Fourier\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "58c17d8b-1b7e-6f79-08ff-74d59e0b3243"],
 " circuit and takes the same ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Eigenvalues\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "43821c38-6720-b4f9-71b1-966212da1ec3"],
 " route as above; ",
 Cell[BoxData["FourierMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "341c54d9-3079-6bba-5c24-4d83410c3980"],
 " knows the answer:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->807053435,ExpressionUUID->"1dbf9c2b-d84a-d79b-4b44-1674d9fcbde1"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "3"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qo", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Fourier\>\"", "[", "n", "]"}], "]"}], 
    "[", "\"\<QuantumOperator\>\"", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"F", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FourierMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
     RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Normal", "[", "F", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
  RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
   RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[14]:= ",
 CellID->1633675818,ExpressionUUID->"0f449897-1a0e-51e7-357b-11d19fbb23cd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", "F", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[15]:= ",
 CellID->1828793009,ExpressionUUID->"6d5a63ab-93b9-14f3-1b7a-7af5264c7ed9"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "==", 
  " ", 
  RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", "F", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[16]:= ",
 CellID->1232986364,ExpressionUUID->"5077c06e-c394-b43c-000c-da4bf6261f06"],

Cell["5. Spectrum of a diagonal operator", "Section",
 CellID->762269937,ExpressionUUID->"07359582-e823-44a1-2eca-0cef89d62e8b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The eigenvalues of a diagonal operator are its diagonal entries, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["spec",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "{", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c239bd0-3ff5-3b18-25d0-129ab9818662"],
 ". QF runs the full eigensolver on the stored matrix, converting it to dense \
first:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->405213039,ExpressionUUID->"68c76573-72ce-0c1a-18fd-7d3d077b5760"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "10"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"h", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"zz", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qo", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "h"}], 
      "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", "n", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", "\n", "    ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"h", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
      "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[17]:= ",
 CellID->2118931930,ExpressionUUID->"6184d2f2-049e-728e-17bb-cbbcad2b40d4"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
     RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Eigenvalues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
      RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
       RowBox[{"h", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
       "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[18]:= ",
 CellID->1039057480,ExpressionUUID->"4fd967ef-5008-0b29-75e7-7ec961bd5673"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A second ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Eigenvalues\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "19bb1c5e-57ab-6e36-4f58-9618625e351c"],
 " call on the same operator is answered from QF's property cache, so this \
gain is on the first call."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1411198270,ExpressionUUID->"5c8dcc56-7aa9-964a-04b2-e6107f5dfc90"],

Cell["6. Change of basis into the Fourier basis", "Section",
 CellID->1703453532,ExpressionUUID->"30baa1c8-66ad-75e0-6059-389213585fca"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Rewriting a state in a new basis with matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["B", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52535901-cb26-8b9c-0261-516aeed0d9e6"],
 " solves"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1477609488,ExpressionUUID->"323a4b1c-b138-a791-63da-6359c0b20dfb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]},
    "Ket"], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], 
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"]},
     "Ket"]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1030824397,ExpressionUUID->"7421cf44-a1ac-4319-1dde-e721d0592e63"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For the Fourier basis, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["B", "TI"], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "511b3347-8d7d-ab60-0738-ab212409f64a"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], "=", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"],
 ". QF inverts the exact basis matrix with ",
 Cell[BoxData["MatrixInverse"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"QuantumState", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", 
    RowBox[{"187", "-", "188"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "519775d4-d545-25f2-07ad-6c91dcf18fd8"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Utilities", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", 
    RowBox[{"295", "-", "299"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"],
 "), an exact inverse of a matrix of roots of unity. QF's Fourier basis \
matrix is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"FourierMatrix", "[", "d", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06ecfdb3-2197-c9b0-2e93-f4fd50239b9a"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->100031176,ExpressionUUID->"12d95fcb-3316-2212-42e7-569546a37178"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"d", " ", "=", " ", "8"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qb", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumBasis", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Fourier\>\"", "[", "d", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"qb", "[", "\"\<Output\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<ReducedMatrix\>\"",
       "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
     RowBox[{"FourierMatrix", "[", "d", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "===", 
  " ", 
  RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
   RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", "d"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[19]:= ",
 CellID->144223354,ExpressionUUID->"733995c2-f5bf-78ee-22c6-0caffc4a4a34"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomComplex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "-", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "d"}], "]"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumState", "[", "v", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"F", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FourierMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"WorkingPrecision", " ", "->", " ", "MachinePrecision"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"QuantumState", "[", 
     RowBox[{"qs", ",", " ", "qb"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Inverse", "[", "F", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}], "]"}]}], 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[20]:= ",
 CellID->1443527617,ExpressionUUID->"4f8ab258-7e7f-0723-7589-34027b0a6a09"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"QuantumState", "[", 
      RowBox[{"qs", ",", " ", "qb"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", 
     "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Inverse", "[", "F", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[21]:= ",
 CellID->311511756,ExpressionUUID->"6b12ee74-9953-131d-1921-003e18e67e67"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The exact inverse grows so fast with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65262d3c-fccc-1dc6-0cdd-c579f579672c"],
 " that QF's change of basis into a 16-dimensional Fourier basis does not \
finish in minutes, while the structured array still answers in milliseconds."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1381425643,ExpressionUUID->"5e157ee2-48da-d240-062b-77cc696ca0aa"],

Cell["7. Quantum Fourier transform of a state", "Section",
 CellID->377280352,ExpressionUUID->"78287f93-0f12-7c52-2828-76ddaaa746b8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Applying the QFT to a state vector is a discrete Fourier transform of its \
amplitudes, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], "\[Function]", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Psi]", "TI"]},
     "Ket"]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "08285353-0e0e-39f8-3828-4b1dabb88bc2"],
 ". QF contracts the gates of its ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Fourier\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1daed7d3-93e8-7698-4b55-ce9d259d5ce2"],
 " circuit as a tensor network. ",
 Cell[BoxData["FourierMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "187adc3d-3961-76c2-4819-d667b8145c28"],
 " applied to a vector runs a fast Fourier transform:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1717363484,ExpressionUUID->"641c78eb-7f03-7846-0c24-71b57ab64aac"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "16"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qc", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Fourier\>\"", "[", "n", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomComplex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "-", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumState", "[", "v", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"F", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FourierMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"WorkingPrecision", " ", "->", " ", "MachinePrecision"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"qc", "[", "qs", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"F", " ", ".", " ", "v"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[22]:= ",
 CellID->1781880651,ExpressionUUID->"5bfcc75d-c21d-6fb0-0983-df06f7a8359a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"qc", "[", "qs", "]"}], "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], "]"}],
    " ", "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{"F", " ", ".", " ", "v"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[23]:= ",
 CellID->1536527082,ExpressionUUID->"112ae6ec-4b5c-6ad2-4729-ffb66ee93838"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Both costs roughly double with each added qubit, so the gap stays about a \
constant factor as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6121b9de-dddd-aca8-10de-309bd469f6f2"],
 " grows. The factor itself is the difference between contracting the circuit \
gate by gate and doing the whole transform in one fast Fourier pass over the \
amplitudes."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1621535814,ExpressionUUID->"30209679-023a-ee91-61df-0823b7ccb4fb"],

Cell["8. Controlled evolution", "Section",
 CellID->1193935837,ExpressionUUID->"29bc1606-c22d-409d-5f43-8863f7d812e7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A Hamiltonian that acts only when a control qubit is in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{"1"},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bf1e1bf-5b3e-c64b-298e-f8f95ec8ac91"],
 " generates a controlled evolution:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->105329933,ExpressionUUID->"3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
     TemplateBox[{"1"},
      "Ket"], 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{"1"},
       "Bra"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
      StyleBox["H", "TI"]}]}]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{"0"},
      "Ket"], 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{"0"},
       "Bra"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
      StyleBox["I", "TI"]}]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{"1"},
      "Ket"], 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{"1"},
       "Bra"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["H", "TI"]}]]}]}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1234416869,ExpressionUUID->"62a6d1b5-4e36-fa69-125d-c8ff6bc0c8b3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The generator is block diagonal, with a zero block and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c41cdc9-5ab3-1ef5-247e-e4935f4664df"],
 ". QF builds it with ",
 Cell[BoxData["QuantumTensorProduct"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "51fce014-dca1-0630-0783-fa51d5546d1a"],
 " and exponentiates the stored ",
 Cell[BoxData["SparseArray"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "657c1c65-980e-511d-1303-964f19bb2067"],
 ". A structured ",
 Cell[BoxData["BlockDiagonalMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0f15dbd5-5f35-596c-352a-d29f5ac02bb6"],
 " exponentiates only the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7e9b7e66-629a-1114-26b9-7040172f607e"],
 " block:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->240380995,ExpressionUUID->"585a51e6-774f-2dd2-087a-48c002fa7738"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "5", "]"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "7"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"t", " ", "=", " ", "0.7"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"k", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"2", "^", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Hm", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"#", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "#", "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], 
     " ", "&"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomComplex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "-", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "k"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qo", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumTensorProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "1", "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Hm", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
        RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"B", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockDiagonalMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "k"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "t", " ", "Hm"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomComplex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "-", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", "k"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "t", " ", "qo"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", "B", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[24]:= ",
 CellID->1771870337,ExpressionUUID->"1d7c0b5b-c40c-ea6a-4b03-a304edbeb8b0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "t", " ", "qo"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"",
      "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}], " ", "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", "B", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[25]:= ",
 CellID->305160771,ExpressionUUID->"370294fd-9e49-2d35-5d31-0da71bfc741f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The fair baseline here is the dense matrix, which WL exponentiates quickly. \
The structured array beats it only once ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2845529c-454d-b13b-587b-4bc66cf90001"],
 " is large, because it skips the zero block:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1896945989,ExpressionUUID->"7519012f-e657-215b-2326-988893e273a1"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Dn", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Developer`ToPackedArray", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "t", " ", 
      RowBox[{"qo", "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", "Dn", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", "B", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[26]:= ",
 CellID->653417278,ExpressionUUID->"594776df-9e75-d16a-0f7d-6f991b01a3b0"],

Cell["\<\
At seven qubits QF, the dense matrix and the structured array all finish in a \
fraction of a second, so nothing here is worth changing. The structured array \
pulls ahead of the dense exponential only from about eleven qubits, where \
skipping the zero block saves real time; this is the one row where the gain \
is a constant factor rather than a change in how the cost grows.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1067269536,ExpressionUUID->"6405505f-4b92-3bd6-0c3b-4a196e24893c"],

Cell["9. Dephasing of a qubit register", "Section",
 CellID->49659130,ExpressionUUID->"6878c7f8-419e-9db5-1807-dea27028e79f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each qubit of a register loses phase coherence at rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48a3d607-c312-9dd3-7850-c860f6a4e739"],
 " while evolving under a diagonal ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "539491e8-328f-8d7b-01ab-08b2473bd441"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->464508221,ExpressionUUID->"7fcf59b5-a5ca-2155-25f5-50fecc7f73bf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "."], "=", "\[ScriptCapitalL]", 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"],
    LimitsPositioning->False], "(", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "-", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], ")"}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1361313038,ExpressionUUID->"023f49e2-a747-9723-33c5-60cfd2f3fa09"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For diagonal ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "21aa1c49-e16c-f406-57a9-9612901edf6c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "289b85cd-827f-9a9c-58b8-1c97370be8e6"],
 " is diagonal on the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox["4", 
   StyleBox["n", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12f3dbee-abc4-6375-4280-d2cbce714e5f"],
 " entries of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7ed5da6f-a344-b859-26ea-dc48d6f60aa3"],
 ": each coherence ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"x", "y"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2cfa2c34-ef50-7d46-5499-c6718ae547ac"],
 " picks up a phase ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "-", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["y", "TI"]]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "362a4e41-4988-041f-5e2a-602b683d6f65"],
 " and decays with the number of qubits where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "01ed6b92-5a5f-fa78-3792-82dc5febc942"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["y", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "107fa29c-d013-1000-4004-3bd9e1a6636a"],
 " differ. QF builds ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6798df62-4cc7-e4e1-0da7-d74c6573cecb"],
 " with its ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Liouvillian\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "49f5450b-e8d1-97dd-7f8b-5d548965fd27"],
 " named operator (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"NamedOperators", ".", 
   RowBox[{"m", ":", 
    RowBox[{"904", "-", "925"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2570a8a5-7a6f-59e7-530f-410f7f1a2bcd"],
 ") and exponentiates it as a dense matrix:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1907680634,ExpressionUUID->"0b990c23-b656-01a6-39a6-a58cc3e3538c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "5"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"t", " ", "=", " ", "0.7"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"h", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"zz", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"H", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "h"}], 
      "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", "n", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"zs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", " ", "@@", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ReplacePart", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", "n"}], 
            "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"k", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"Range", "[", "n", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"L", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Liouvillian\>\"", "[", 
     RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "zs", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0.2", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"L", "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
   RowBox[{"m", " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "m", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[27]:= ",
 CellID->483148123,ExpressionUUID->"52243646-2fbd-210e-03db-a8204a487054"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The largest off-diagonal entry is zero, so ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1acd7f4d-3da3-7753-4af3-7717b4565db9"],
 " is its diagonal:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1195452142,ExpressionUUID->"062d91f0-6326-41c0-2fd2-08ba16d3132a"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "m", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
    RowBox[{"RandomComplex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], " ", "-", " ", "I"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "I"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Length", "[", "l", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"compare", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"t", " ", "L"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"timeNew", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"t", " ", 
      RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
       RowBox[{"l", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
       "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[28]:= ",
 CellID->1521685512,ExpressionUUID->"1ac7f74a-ce09-be58-4afc-ef17ebbd04a2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{"t", " ", "L"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}], " ", ".", 
    " ", "v"}], " ", "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"t", " ", 
      RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
       RowBox[{"l", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
       "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[29]:= ",
 CellID->97201263,ExpressionUUID->"6f6ad260-8ee1-565a-1569-d44a2a943ca0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Open-system evolution is where the gap opens earliest: the superoperator \
lives on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox["4", 
   StyleBox["n", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "612fd791-c81e-86f2-10d4-cedae9a8ecd8"],
 " entries, so QF's dense exponential becomes slow already at a handful of \
qubits."
}], "Text",
 CellID->878831761,ExpressionUUID->"26dca2d1-2715-746d-4ee3-3b9b52a05eb7"],

Cell["10. Whole jobs: phase estimation and QAOA", "Section",
 CellID->1048559713,ExpressionUUID->"296a77cd-8fa3-dd44-5f6a-6e972a57a7ae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A single operation can be fast or slow in isolation; what a user waits for \
is a whole job. Two common jobs are timed here, each against every method QF \
offers for applying a circuit: its default tensor-network contraction, the \
same contraction along a greedy contraction path, and the gate-by-gate ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Schrodinger\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],
 " method. ",
 Cell[BoxData["table"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25b5b884-ef74-61b3-534a-31e18a013399"],
 " lists the times:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->300048012,ExpressionUUID->"574a2197-51ef-7938-7d49-b8d1679a4802"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"table", "[", "rows_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"#1", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Quantity", "[", 
            RowBox[{"#2", ",", " ", "\"\<Seconds\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", 
         "&"}], " ", "@@@", " ", "rows"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<method\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<time\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
     ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"greedy", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<TensorNetwork\>\"", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Path\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Greedy\>\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[30]:= ",
 CellID->1962937852,ExpressionUUID->"6e85e9ed-427b-8528-16ba-00b7770fec72"],

Cell["Phase estimation", "Subsection",
 CellID->588230824,ExpressionUUID->"73b76025-96bb-3fff-214d-798f234f85c5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "QF's ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<PhaseEstimation\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31f4c073-8ff6-126f-678b-da3d298360b5"],
 " circuit prepares the counting register, applies the controlled powers of \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["U", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "72ff7667-e560-b2c0-2285-68408c1a002a"],
 ", and ends with the inverse QFT and a measurement of each counting qubit. \
Dropping the measurements leaves the state to compare; dropping the inverse \
QFT too leaves the part that stays with QF, after which the inverse QFT is \
applied as an inverse fast Fourier transform along the counting register:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->2099309037,ExpressionUUID->"7c9be80e-0554-61c1-24b8-0268ace1332b"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"invQFT", "[", 
    RowBox[{"v_", ",", " ", "n_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", 
        RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "v", "]"}], "/", 
            RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
       RowBox[{"InverseFourier", " ", "/@", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "m", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "3", "]"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"u", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<RandomUnitary\>\"", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "12"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"els", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<PhaseEstimation\>\"", "[", 
      RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Elements\>\"", 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"body", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Drop", "[", 
     RowBox[{"els", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"-", "n"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"front", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Drop", "[", 
     RowBox[{"els", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"n", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Last", "[", 
   RowBox[{"body", "[", "\"\<Elements\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Label\>\"",
   "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[31]:= ",
 CellID->512383039,ExpressionUUID->"106b7ad8-6378-599b-4069-7382160d2be1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The block dropped from ",
 Cell[BoxData["front"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7e6f7c7a-fa8f-2da1-2615-7627ff3a778b"],
 " is the inverse QFT. The whole job, each way:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->273308241,ExpressionUUID->"304452a4-201b-d64c-607c-4b0e51afbc96"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"table", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF, default contraction\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"body", "[", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF, greedy path\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"body", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "greedy"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
     "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF, Schrodinger\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"body", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Schrodinger\>\""}], "]"}], 
       "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF without inverse QFT, then FFT\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"invQFT", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"front", "[", "]"}], "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], 
          "]"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF greedy without inverse QFT, then FFT\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"invQFT", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"front", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "greedy"}], "]"}], 
           "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], 
       "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[32]:= ",
 CellID->1809098798,ExpressionUUID->"6beff1f8-c64a-83a6-1994-e8a5f3fcd18c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"invQFT", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"front", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "greedy"}], "]"}], 
       "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", 
   "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"body", "[", "]"}], "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[33]:= ",
 CellID->156430199,ExpressionUUID->"4b5b9263-9199-4e16-7978-144d202c157c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The inverse QFT is a large share of the default contraction, and there are \
two ways to remove that cost: the fast Fourier transform, or a greedy \
contraction path, which orders the same gates so that the intermediate \
tensors stay small. Each recovers a similar factor on its own, and together \
they give the fastest run. With a two-qubit ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["U", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "475d7054-346c-a3cc-6d63-6a1ebd1ef116"],
 " the whole job stays short at every size tried, so for phase estimation the \
saving is real but small in absolute terms; it matters when the job is \
repeated many times. A larger ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["U", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],
 " makes its controlled powers more expensive, which should shrink the QFT's \
share further; that case is not timed here."
}], "Text",
 CellID->724760089,ExpressionUUID->"3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],

Cell["QAOA", "Subsection",
 CellID->168408080,ExpressionUUID->"20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A depth-one QAOA scan evaluates the energy ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["C", "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"],
 " of the Ising cost function on a grid of angles ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["\[Beta]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],
 ". The circuit is a layer of Hadamards, one ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"i", "j"}], "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],
 " gate for each of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"],
 " pairs, and one ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    StyleBox["\[Beta]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],
 " on each qubit. The whole cost layer is the diagonal ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["h", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],
 ", so the structured route replaces those ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],
 " gates by one diagonal multiply and hands only the mixer to QF:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->811283638,ExpressionUUID->"10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"zzJ", "[", 
    RowBox[{"J_", ",", " ", "n_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"z", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}]}]}],
       "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"J", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "i"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"i", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "12"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "5", "]"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"J", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"RandomReal", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"h", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"zzJ", "[", 
    RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qc", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Join", "[", "\n", "        ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<H\>\"", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", "i", "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
       RowBox[{"Flatten", " ", "@", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Gamma]", " ", 
               RowBox[{"J", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", 
                 RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
              " ", "\"\<ZZ\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"i", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\"\<RX\>\"", "[", 
            RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Beta]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", "i", "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "    ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Parameters\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\[Beta]"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mix", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumCircuitOperator", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<RX\>\"", "[", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Beta]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "i", "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Parameters\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", "\[Beta]", "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"grid", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0.1", ",", " ", "1.0", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0.1", ",", " ", "1.0", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"v0", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"1", "/", 
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
       RowBox[{"2.", "^", "n"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"energy", "[", "v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "v", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"h", " ", "v"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"qfScan", "[", "m_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"energy", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"qc", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"#", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"#", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "m"}], "]"}], 
        "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@",
     " ", "grid"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"structuredScan", "[", "m_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"energy", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"mix", "[", 
          RowBox[{"#", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"QuantumState", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{"#", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "h"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
              
              RowBox[{
              "TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
             "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "v0"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "m"}]}], "]"}], 
        "[", "\"\<StateVector\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@",
     " ", "grid"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[34]:= ",
 CellID->207978548,ExpressionUUID->"3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The QF ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ",", " ", "\"\<ZZ\>\""}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],
 " gate is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Theta]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "/", "2"}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],
 ", so each gate above is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"i", "j"}], "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],
 " and their product is exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["h", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],
 ". The scan, each way (the ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Schrodinger\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],
 " method is far slower than both contractions for this circuit and is left \
out to keep the page quick to run):"
}], "Text",
 CellID->437474228,ExpressionUUID->"4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"table", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", "\n", "    ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF, default contraction\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"qfScan", "[", "Automatic", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
    "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<QF, greedy path\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"qfScan", "[", "greedy", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
    "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<structured cost layer, QF default mixer\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"structuredScan", "[", "Automatic", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
     "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<structured cost layer, QF greedy mixer\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"timeQF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"structuredScan", "[", "greedy", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
   "}"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[35]:= ",
 CellID->874582697,ExpressionUUID->"66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"qfScan", "[", "greedy", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"structuredScan", "[", "greedy", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[36]:= ",
 CellID->11631581,ExpressionUUID->"0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],

Cell["\<\
Here a contraction path helps much less than in phase estimation: the cost of \
this circuit is the number of two-qubit gates, and reordering them does not \
remove any. The structured cost layer removes them all, so it wins whichever \
method applies the mixer, and the time that remains is the mixer's \
single-qubit layer run through QF. Over the sizes tried the factor between \
QF's default and the structured route stays roughly constant, so the time \
saved grows in step with the job itself.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1933762060,ExpressionUUID->"0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],

Cell["Where structured arrays do not help", "Section",
 CellID->1055776787,ExpressionUUID->"6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["HadamardMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"],
 " has no structured form that applies ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],
 " quickly: it accepts only ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Dense\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3279c00f-c9e2-8758-6206-da68ef94eda2"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Orthogonal\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "50b12ff8-e606-85f7-004e-c6a593b0efdd"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Unitary\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "640f47a5-4648-c62d-0c35-5e0f73e2ad77"],
 " as target structures, and the last two wrap the dense matrix."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1859711813,ExpressionUUID->"63a48922-0fac-666c-115b-208caa594cb6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Head", " ", "/@", " ", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"HadamardMatrix", "[", 
     RowBox[{"8", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<BitComplement\>\""}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Orthogonal\>\""}]}], 
     "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"HadamardMatrix", "[", 
     RowBox[{"8", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<BitComplement\>\""}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Unitary\>\""}]}], 
     "]"}]}], "}"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[37]:= ",
 CellID->1348896709,ExpressionUUID->"387a9e0d-0234-0e73-6819-1057b7c15559"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["Eigensystem"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f64ca0d-9927-5f44-651b-ec5718d225ae"],
 " of a ",
 Cell[BoxData["DiagonalMatrix"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "399d1ff3-4632-be92-6fa2-96bd73c404f8"],
 " head returns malformed eigenvectors in WL 15.0, while ",
 Cell[BoxData["Eigenvalues"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1170384d-2f38-2c50-470f-b2174acd76ba"],
 " is correct. A bare ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", "list", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ce33075-6d34-44a7-1490-aa3f04c12e8d"],
 " with more than 1000 entries is structured by default, so this also happens \
with no option given:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1427211115,ExpressionUUID->"54e2b6d5-0ba4-5b19-7c91-2f9fae512663"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Eigensystem", "[", 
  RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"1.", ",", " ", "3.", ",", " ", "4."}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"TargetStructure", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Structured\>\""}]}], 
   "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[38]:= ",
 CellID->2099805207,ExpressionUUID->"6334ac9c-43f1-85c0-12cb-45c67585ef2a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The structured array pays whenever the operator's structure already fixes \
the answer and QF recomputes it from scratch: the exponential and spectrum of \
a diagonal are its entries, a permutation's spectrum comes from its cycles, \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], "=", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["F", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["F", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],
 " on a vector is a fast Fourier transform. It stops paying where the work is \
genuinely dense, as for the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"],
 " block of a controlled evolution, and wherever WL has no structured form, \
as for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"],
 ". In whole jobs the gain follows the share of the work the structure \
covers: large for QAOA, whose cost layer is entirely diagonal, and modest for \
phase estimation, where the QFT is one block among the controlled powers and \
a greedy contraction path already recovers much of the same time."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1402006442,ExpressionUUID->"045023ab-c37d-b770-2c6f-baf4f6091a5a"]
},
FrontEndVersion->"15.0 for Mac OS X ARM (64-bit) (July 2, 2026)",
